  "answer_markdown": "The feedback notes several issues across different sections of the app:\n\n### **Profile & Menu**\n* **Profile and Nationality:** Selecting nationality is \"too slow to populate your country\", lacks a back button to the home screen, and saving keeps the user \"stuck on the page, unless you press the taleer logo\" [1]. Additionally, changing nationality did not update the flag [1]. Users also cannot yet upload a selfie, phone camera picture, or LinkedIn picture [1].\n* **Non-Working Menu Items:** **My Applications** freezes the whole app when pressed [1]. **Settings**, **Plans & Billings**, **Help & Support**, and **Privacy & Data** are listed as \"Not working\" [1].\n* **Navigation in Terms & Privacy:** Pressing the back button on **Terms of Service** and **Privacy Policy** redirects to the Taleer website (`taleer.ai`) and waitlist form instead of the home screen [1].\n\n### **Visa Guide**\n* **Country List & Info:** The country list includes incorrect countries (like United Kingdom and South Africa) [3]. Selecting a country provides information that \"only speak about UK nations\" [3].\n* **Speed and Details:** Information generation is too slow for **Visas & residency**, **Cost of Living** (over 25s), **Housing** (over 30s), **Banking** (over 35s), and **Pre-Departure Checklist** (20s) [3]. Housing lacks website links to property sources, and International Schools only list British and American schools [3]. Information sources are not listed [3].\n\n### **Career Intelligence & Latest Activity**\n* **Salary Index:** Listed amounts show 3-digit (100k) monthly salaries, and India is missing [4].\n* **Latest Activity:** The section lists \"nothing but CV updates\" instead of displaying the latest update from each stage [6].\n\n### **Smart Job Search**\n* **Search Fields UI & Input:** When typing in the Industry or Job Title search fields, the search field is \"pushed to the top of the screen and you can’t see what you are typing until you start typing\" [5]. Manually typed industries or job titles do not populate back to the search criteria page [5].\n* **Job Titles & Location:** The list of job titles is too small [5]. Location is an open field rather than a dropdown [5].\n* **Job Matches Counter:** The total count of jobs matched only links to Industry, does not adjust when changing job titles or adding industries, and only refreshes after leaving and returning to the home screen [5].",
